_“18.7. Bolt also reserves the right to immediately_ *_suspend any access_* _in whole or_ *_in part_* _in association with Your TVDE Operator Account_ *_during the period of investigation_*_,_ *_if Bolt suspects_* _a breach of the Agreement by the TVDE Operator, damage to Bolt's brand reputation or business, or_ *_fraudulent activity_*_. Any such suspension will be of reasonable duration and only so long as the investigation is underway. Bolt shall make use of the right described above in good faith. The TVDE Operator will be informed of the reasons for this decision in a durable medium before the restriction takes effect or at the time it takes effect and will be given the opportunity to clarify the facts and circumstances of the suspected breach.”_

