To test this, you need to set up internal keys rotator script first in Postman:
[https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/1489076382/How+to+call+APIs+on+prelive#Internal-key-rotator-pre-request-script-%5BinlineExtension%5D|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/1489076382/How+to+call+APIs+on+prelive#Internal-key-rotator-pre-request-script-%5BinlineExtension%5D|smart-link] 

Then you need to add your push token to whitelist:

[https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/4093411850/Limitations+of+push+notifications+testing#Whitelist-accessing-self-service|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/4093411850/Limitations+of+push+notifications+testing#Whitelist-accessing-self-service|smart-link] 

After doing so, call the endpoint [{color:#ffffff}http://node.prelive.boltint.net/live-activity-tokens-rider/comms/setLiveActivityToken?deviceId=AAA&version=CA.90.0&deviceType=android&device_name=TEST&device_os_version=13&language=en{color}|http://node.prelive.boltint.net/live-activity-tokens-rider/comms/setLiveActivityToken?deviceId=AAA&version=CA.90.0&deviceType=android&device_name=TEST&device_os_version=13&language=en] (altering the query parameters if needed) with the following payload.

{code:json}{
    "token" : "<insert anything here>",
    "token_type" : "fcm", // or "hms", or "aps"
    "capabilities" : [<any array of strings>],
    "subject" : {
        "type" : "order",
        "order_system" : "taxi",
        "city_id" : <any integer id>,
        "order_id" : <any integer id>
    }
}{code}

Please remember that for this one you need regular user auth, not internal one. You can see how to set it up here:

[https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/1489076382/How+to+call+APIs+on+prelive#Client-authentication-pre-request-script-%5BinlineExtension%5D|https://taxify.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ENGINEERING/pages/1489076382/How+to+call+APIs+on+prelive#Client-authentication-pre-request-script-%5BinlineExtension%5D|smart-link] 



Then, call [{color:#ffffff}http://node.prelive.boltint.net/live-activity-tokens-internal/internal/internalGetLiveActivityToken{color}|http://node.prelive.boltint.net/live-activity-tokens-internal/internal/internalGetLiveActivityToken] (with internal auth) with the following payload:

{code:json}{
    "subject" : {
        "type" : "order",
        "order_system" : "taxi",
        "city_id" : <same city id you've used in the previous call>,
        "order_id" : <same order id you've used in the previous call>
    },
    "user_handle" : {
        "user_type" : "rider",
        "user_id" : <id of user you authorised previous call with>
    }
